# Pinned databases used ONLY to build the image that `plugins_test` runs against
# docs/multiple-tests. Released images always ship the latest databases.
#
# Pinning keeps results.xml stable: without it, every Trivy DB or OpenSSF update
# changes the expected findings and fails CI on unrelated PRs.
#
# Refresh with scripts/pin_fixture_dbs.sh, then rebuild the fixtures image and
# regenerate results.xml in the same PR (see "Fixture test databases" in README.md).

